{"id":524594,"title":"Malformed metadata in summer_1am wallpaper causes repeated qt.imageformats.tiff ImageLength warnings","line":"The summer_1am wallpaper no longer makes Dolphin and the wallpaper picker print a burst of \"TIFF directory is missing required ImageLength\" warnings.","kind":"easy","status":"fixed","repos":["plasma-workspace-wallpapers"],"date":"2026-11-21","explanation":"The EXIF data of both summer_1am JPEGs (the 2560x1600 image and screenshot.jpg) describes the embedded thumbnail with Compression=0, which is not a valid value, although the thumbnail itself is a normal JPEG. Readers then treat it as an uncompressed TIFF thumbnail without dimensions, and Qt's TIFF plugin warns about the missing ImageLength each time the file's thumbnail or metadata is read. The change sets that one EXIF field to 6 (JPEG) in both files; the picture, the thumbnail and all other metadata, including the license comment, are untouched.","commits":[{"repo":"plasma-workspace-wallpapers","message":"summer_1am: fix invalid compression tag of the EXIF thumbnail\n\nBoth summer_1am JPEGs declare their EXIF thumbnail with compression 0,\nwhich is invalid, so image readers parse it as TIFF and repeatedly warn\nabout a missing ImageLength field. Mark it as the JPEG (6) it really is.\n\nBUG: 524594"}],"patches":[{"repo":"plasma-workspace-wallpapers","diff":"diff --git a/summer_1am/contents/images/2560x1600.jpg b/summer_1am/contents/images/2560x1600.jpg\nindex 6c60a2b..7152bad 100644\n--- a/summer_1am/contents/images/2560x1600.jpg\n+++ b/summer_1am/contents/images/2560x1600.jpg\n@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@\n-����\u0000\u0010JFIF\u0000\u0001\u0001\u0001\u0000H\u0000H\u0000\u0000��\u000b�Exif\u0000\u0000MM\u0000*\u0000\u0000\u0000\b\u0000\u0004\u0001\u001a\u0000\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000>\u0001\u001b\u0000\u0005\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000F\u0001(\u0000\u0003\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000�i\u0000\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0001\u0000\u0000\u0000